// A core-fund sweep is the SAME DOLLARS changing shape inside one account. It is not a
// receipt, not a payment, and not spending, and the single largest error in the first pass
// at this ledger came from a reading that treated a sweep as a disappearance. The arrival
// and the sweep are recorded as one transaction precisely so that no consumer can pick up
// half of the pair.
